<Base title="Privacy policy">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated 2026-10-05</p>
  <p>This policy covers a personal tool operated by its owner, Gustav Fredrikson, for his own Google accounts only. It has no other users.</p>
  <h2>Data accessed</h2>
  <p>With the owner's consent the tool reads Gmail message metadata and snippets (sender, subject, date, preview), and reads and edits events in the owner's own Google Calendar.</p>
  <h2>Use and sharing</h2>
  <p>The data is used only to produce reminders and manage the owner's own calendar. It is not sold, shared with third parties, used for advertising, or used to train models.</p>
  <h2>Storage</h2>
  <p>OAuth refresh tokens are stored encrypted on a server controlled by the owner. Access can be revoked at any time at <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">myaccount.google.com/permissions</a>.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>gustavfredrikson98@gmail.com</p>
</Base>
